# Lint reports
#
# These patterns previously missed the reports that actually get generated --
# note eslint_report.json (underscore) vs the eslint-report.json below -- so
# ~40MB of ESLint output sat tracked at the repo root, shipped into the Docker
# build context via `COPY . .`, and made `git grep` unusable. Removed 2026-07-31.
eslint-report.json
eslint_report.json
eslint-*-report.json
*-lint-report.json
*_lint_report.json
lint-*.json
server-services-lint.json
unused-vars-*.json
naming-report-*.json
naming-ui.json
naming-ui-verified.json
*-strict-bool.json
config-dump.json
sample-report.json

